628603156.467300","attachments":[{"fallback":"Mobile Factory Tech Blog: 突撃！ 在宅の開発環境 2021年夏 - Mobile Factory Tech Blog","id":1,"title":"突撃！ 在宅の開発環境 2021年夏 - Mobile Factory Tech Blog","title_link":"https://tech.mobilefactory.jp/entry/2021/08/10/100000","text":"はじめに こんにちは。ブロックチェーンチームのエンジニア、 @nanamachi です。 \u003chttp://tech.mobilefactory.jp|tech.mobilefactory.jp\u003e 前回の記事ではたくさんの方に閲覧\u0026amp;コメントいただきありがとうございました。この記事から1年。モバイルファクトリーは日本のどこからでも働けるようになり、書籍購入、資格取得、セミナー参加、懇親会の支援制度などフルリモートに適応できるよう多くの変化をしてきました ( \u003chttps://recruit.mobilefactory.jp/work-style/\u003e )。その中で社員の環境もさまざま変わったことでしょう。 この変化を記事にすれば、閲覧数を稼げる 弊社の魅力を発信で…","image_url":"https://cdn-ak.f.st-hatena.com/images/fotolife/N/Nanamachi/20210721/20210721135240.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1628557200,"service_name":"Mobile Factory Tech Blog","service_icon":"https://tech.mobilefactory.jp/icon/touch","from_url":"https://tech.mobilefactory.jp/entry/2021/08/10/100000","original_url":"https://tech.mobilefactory.jp/entry/2021/08/10/100000"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zUlL"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U02AQSFHYDQ","text":"\u003c@U02AQSFHYDQ\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1628598265.467100","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"03159f68-2888-41ce-b429-13c394704bb2","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"寝る前はローズかラベンダー。\n最初はｳｯってなってましたが、慣れると落ち着きます。","ts":"1628594913.466600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":3,"users":["UKHUVMBJR","U76V658V6","U76GA7MFA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MNG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4e744f50-6c51-445c-a52c-b80517026b2c","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"つい最近はじめたばかりですが、けっこういいですね。\nご飯食べた午後にペパーミントを使ってますが、眠くなりづらい。","ts":"1628594887.466000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hDqG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58d49ede-6880-4751-99d3-cf6bef930192","type":"message","user":"U76V658V6","text":"お香やアロマって落ち着くのでいいですよね。","ts":"1628594827.465100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b01"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7dc3afcb-1d56-4dfb-8251-d2dcb61f9fe3","type":"message","user":"U76V658V6","text":"ティーライトキャンドルを使うデフューザーは棚から落として割ってしまったので、それいらい買ってなくて、100 個近くのティーライトキャンドルが押入れにしまい込まれています。","ts":"1628594740.464800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZjkQG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56190ace-4729-4481-b080-0ee920ce60af","type":"message","user":"U76V658V6","text":"人によっては脱脂綿にエッセンシャルオイルを垂らして普通の小皿に置いてる人も。","ts":"1628594613.463400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+oqM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"beeffda0-d13a-4964-9385-c5ae420ccace","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"デュフューザーも考えたのですが、メンテの手間があるとのことだったのでやめました。\nポットも水を張った器を洗う必要があるのですが、これは雰囲気重視w","ts":"1628594538.462200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3wj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"911c4796-d3bf-481d-afab-113367aec1bb","type":"message","user":"U76V658V6","text":"でもお手軽なのは \u003c@U76GA7MFA\u003e さんがおっしゃっているアロマストーンでしょうか。","ts":"1628594527.461900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r8tN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2fa507f0-7f28-4210-ad08-872df9ec9177","type":"message","user":"U76V658V6","text":"あと風情はなくなりますが ( あるものもありますが ) ネブライザー式のアロマディフューザだと火を使わないので安全ですね。自宅にはなくて旅の宿で使われてたんですけど。","ts":"1628594453.460300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qda"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f65984e0-3067-465a-b652-4210cb3c5631","type":"message","user":"U76V658V6","text":"お香に火をつけずに香りを楽しむ方法もあります。特にアロマ系のお香でそうする人が少なくないようです。お香のメーカーさんがそう言ってるので、まぁ嘘ではないんでしょう。私もシトロネラ系のタイのお香を炊かずにそのまま置いてます。手持ちのタイのお香って火をつけると異様にけぶいので。虫だけでなく人も燻されてしまうので。当然シトロネラの香りなんて煙の匂いで消えてしまうので。","ts":"1628594147.458800","edited":{"user":"U76V658V6","ts":"1628594219.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U72TB62UF"]},{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U76GA7MFA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=iXrk"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","ts":"1628593510.455600","files":[{"id":"F02AWRJV004","created":1628593507,"timestamp":1628593507,"name":"227147033_10226370141023948_7143668771309298875_n.jpg","title":"227147033_10226370141023948_7143668771309298875_n.jpg","mimetype":"image/jpeg","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"jpg","pretty_type":"JPEG","user":"U72TB62UF","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":78490,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02AWRJV004/227147033_10226370141023948_7143668771309298875_n.jpg","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02AWRJV004/download/227147033_10226370141023948_7143668771309298875_n.jpg","original_h":2015,"original_w":1504,"thumb_64":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02AWRJV004-5d3802f7c4/227147033_10226370141023948_7143668771309298875_n_64.jpg","thumb_80":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02AWRJV004-5d3802f7c4/227147033_10226370141023948_7143668771309298875_n_80.jpg","thumb_160":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02AWRJV004-5d3802f7c4/227147033_10226370141023948_7143668771309298875_n_160.jpg","thumb_360":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02AWRJV004-5d3802f7c4/227147033_10226370141023948_7143668771309298875_n_360.jpg","thumb_360_gif":"","thumb_360_w":269,"thumb_360_h":360,"thumb_480":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02AWRJV004-5d3802f7c4/227147033_10226370141023948_7143668771309298875_n_480.jpg","thumb_480_w":358,"thumb_480_h":480,"thumb_7