ルは、以前はアロマディフューザーを使っていましたが、最近はアロマストーンに垂らすだけのことが多いです。","ts":"1628592438.454100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nqf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"74fd1019-2d9a-4feb-b720-2aeb5c843459","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"アロマポットを愛用していたのですが、火を使うので睡眠時に使えないため、別のを探していました。","ts":"1628591989.452900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4ig"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b72dfa35-1e55-41a4-a705-7e4d15220273","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"まだエッセンシャルオイルくらいしか試してませんでした。お香も良さそう。","ts":"1628591896.452200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"twY"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"\u003c@U72TB62UF\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1628591775.451800","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"\u003c@U72TB62UF\u003e has left the channel","ts":"1628591768.451600","subtype":"channel_leave","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"4c86eade-0b29-4a37-8e02-efef1845185e","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"お香はガジェット","ts":"1628591669.451100","files":[{"id":"F02AQNZRJNP","created":1628591661,"timestamp":1628591661,"name":"20210810_193157.jpg","title":"20210810_193157.jpg","mimetype":"image/jpeg","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"jpg","pretty_type":"JPEG","user":"U72TB62UF","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":1194216,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02AQNZRJNP/20210810_193157.jpg","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02AQNZRJNP/download/20210810_193157.jpg","original_h":3024,"original_w":4032,"thumb_64":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02AQNZRJNP-39c9121d09/20210810_193157_64.